/* =====================================================================
   Torrent 2000 -- "CCCP" skin, NORMAL variant
   Soviet-constructivist propaganda-poster aesthetic (Rodchenko / El
   Lissitzky): flat, high-contrast fields, thick square-cut ink borders,
   bold stencil-style type. No gradients, no soft pastel shading -- a
   real poster is silkscreened in a handful of flat colors, not airbrushed.

   This is the "normal" appearance mode, not a literal light theme: CCCP
   predates the very idea of a light/dark toggle (see theme_manager.py's
   module docstring), so "normal" here means the poster mounted on its
   usual dark board -- cccp_dark.qss pushes the same board toward pure
   black for users who want the darker system-wide look, and
   cccp_dark_hc.qss reduces it to the accessibility-mandated black/white/
   yellow contract. All three keep the exact same identity: crimson red
   balanced by gold and parchment cream -- NOT a wall of red. Red is the
   accent that punctuates; gold and cream carry just as much weight.

   TOKENS (hex, named)
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
     bg               #161616   canvas the poster board sits on
     surface          #1F1F1F   panel / card / raised board
     border           #EDE6D0   parchment ink-line (NOT stark white --
                                 warmed toward cream so it belongs to
                                 the same family as the text, instead of
                                 reading as generic "SaaS neutral" grey)
     text             #F2E4C4   parchment cream -- identical to the
                                 custom title bar's caption text color
                                 (app_title_bar.py / theme_manager.py),
                                 so body copy and caption read as one
                                 continuous poster rather than two
                                 mismatched surfaces
     text-muted       #A6976E   dulled parchment (secondary copy)
     accent (red)     #C1272D   primary interactive red -- brightened
                                 above the title bar's caption red
                                 (#7A0C0C) so it stays legible as a small
                                 accent against a near-black surface;
                                 same hue family, lifted for contrast
     accent-hover     #D4AF37   gold -- identical to the title bar's own
                                 hover gold (minmax_hover_color /
                                 close_hover_color in theme_manager.py).
                                 Every hover state in this stylesheet
                                 resolves to red-becomes-gold, mirroring
                                 exactly what happens when you hover the
                                 real caption buttons.
     danger           #A31515   destructive-action red -- identical to
                                 the title bar's own button fill
                                 (minmax_fill_color / close_fill_color),
                                 with the same gold hover. The one button
                                 allowed to BE red instead of bordered by
                                 it uses the *exact* red the window chrome
                                 itself is built from.

   Utility shades (not part of the named palette, purely structural):
     inset            #0D0D0D   recessed field background (carved-in look)
     disabled-border  #3A3A3A   neutral (deliberately NOT warm -- a
                                 disabled control should read as "switched
                                 off," not as a dimmer parchment tone)
     disabled-text    #6E6E6E

   The title bar (solid red caption, hammer-and-sickle close button) is
   NOT drawn by this stylesheet -- see src/torrent2000/ui/widgets/
   app_title_bar.py and ui/theme/theme_manager.py. Two theme-specific
   mechanics live outside QSS entirely: downloading is blocked while this
   theme is active (engine/session_manager.py) and sharing counts for 3x
   toward the level (stats/leveling.py).
   ===================================================================== */

* {
    font-family: "Arial", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
}

QMainWindow, QWidget#centralWidget, QDialog {
    background-color: #161616;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

QWidget {
    background-color: #161616;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tabs */

QTabWidget::pane {
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    background-color: #161616;
    top: -1px;
}

QTabWidget#mainTabs::pane {
    border-top: none;
    top: 0px;
}

QTabBar::tab {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 5px 16px;
    margin-right: 1px;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QTabBar::tab:hover:!selected {
    background-color: #2A2A2A;
    color: #D4AF37;
    border-color: #D4AF37;
}

QTabBar::tab:selected {
    background-color: #161616;
    border-color: #EDE6D0;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #C1272D;
    margin-top: 0px;
    color: #C1272D;
}

QTabBar::tab:!selected {
    margin-top: 2px;
}

QTabBar::tab:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: -3px;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ GroupBox */

QGroupBox {
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    border-top: 4px solid #C1272D;
    border-radius: 0px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #C1272D;
}

QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    left: 10px;
    top: -2px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    color: #C1272D;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------- Buttons */

QPushButton {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    min-height: 18px;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton:hover:!pressed {
    background-color: #2A2A2A;
    border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    color: #D4AF37;
}

QPushButton:pressed {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
    color: #C1272D;
}

QPushButton:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

QPushButton:default {
    border-width: 3px;
    border-color: #C1272D;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QPushButton:disabled {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

/* The one button allowed to BE red instead of merely bordered by it --
   removing a torrent is exactly the kind of decisive action this
   theme's red accent is reserved for. Fill and hover match the real
   title bar's close/minmax button colors exactly (see theme_manager.py). */
QPushButton#dangerButton {
    background-color: #A31515;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    min-height: 16px;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:hover:!pressed {
    background-color: #D4AF37;
    border: 2px solid #F2E4C4;
    color: #161616;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:pressed {
    background-color: #6E0E0E;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #F2E4C4;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:disabled {
    background-color: #3A1414;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------- Text input */

QLineEdit, QSpinBox, QAbstractSpinBox {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    selection-background-color: #C1272D;
    selection-color: #F2E4C4;
}

QLineEdit:hover, QSpinBox:hover, QAbstractSpinBox:hover {
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
}

QLineEdit:focus, QSpinBox:focus, QAbstractSpinBox:focus {
    border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QLineEdit:disabled, QSpinBox:disabled, QAbstractSpinBox:disabled {
    background-color: #161616;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-button, QAbstractSpinBox::down-button {
    subcontrol-origin: border;
    width: 16px;
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border-left: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-button {
    subcontrol-position: top right;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::down-button {
    subcontrol-position: bottom right;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 4px solid #F2E4C4;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::down-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-top: 4px solid #F2E4C4;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-arrow:disabled, QAbstractSpinBox::down-arrow:disabled {
    border-bottom-color: #6E6E6E;
    border-top-color: #6E6E6E;
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- Combo */

QComboBox {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

QComboBox:hover {
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
}

QComboBox:focus {
    border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QComboBox:disabled {
    background-color: #161616;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

QComboBox::drop-down {
    subcontrol-origin: padding;
    subcontrol-position: right;
    width: 20px;
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border-left: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QComboBox::down-arrow {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    image: none;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-top: 4px solid #F2E4C4;
}

QComboBox::down-arrow:disabled {
    border-top: 4px solid #6E6E6E;
}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
    outline: none;
    selection-background-color: #C1272D;
    selection-color: #F2E4C4;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ Checkbox */

QCheckBox {
    color: #F2E4C4;
    spacing: 6px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:hover {
    border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background-color: #C1272D;
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
    image: url(theme:checkmark.png);
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked:hover {
    background-color: #D4AF37;
    border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:disabled {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked:disabled {
    background-color: #6E6E6E;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QCheckBox:disabled {
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- Slider */

QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    height: 4px;
    background-color: #3A3A3A;
    border: 2px solid #0D0D0D;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    width: 14px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    background-color: #C1272D;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #D4AF37;
    border: 2px solid #F2E4C4;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #D4AF37;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:disabled {
    background-color: #6E6E6E;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QSlider::groove:horizontal:disabled {
    background-color: #2A2A2A;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------- Tables and trees */

QTableWidget, QTreeWidget {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    alternate-background-color: #1A1A1A;
    gridline-color: #3A3A3A;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    selection-background-color: #C1272D;
    selection-color: #F2E4C4;
    outline: none;
}

QTableWidget::item, QTreeWidget::item {
    padding: 2px;
}

QTableWidget::item:hover, QTreeWidget::item:hover {
    background-color: #2A1414;
}

QTableWidget::item:selected, QTreeWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: #C1272D;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #C1272D;
}

QHeaderView::section:hover {
    color: #D4AF37;
    border-color: #D4AF37;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------- ListBox */

QListWidget {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    outline: none;
}

QListWidget::item {
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
}

QListWidget::item:hover {
    background-color: #2A1414;
    border-left: 3px solid #D4AF37;
}

QListWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: #C1272D;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    border-left: 3px solid #D4AF37;
}

QListWidget::item:selected:!active {
    background-color: #6E0E0E;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ Menu -- */
/* Context menus (right-click on the Downloads/Share tables) need to look
   like part of the same poster, not fall back to native Windows chrome. */

QMenu {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    border: 2px solid #EDE6D0;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    padding: 3px;
}

QMenu::item {
    background-color: transparent;
    padding: 5px 24px 5px 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
}

QMenu::item:selected {
    background-color: #C1272D;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    border-left: 3px solid #D4AF37;
}

QMenu::item:disabled {
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

QMenu::separator {
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #D4AF37;
    margin: 4px 8px;
}

QMenu::icon {
    padding-left: 6px;
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------- ProgressBar */

/* The "People's Progress" -- red filling on a dark groove. */
QProgressBar {
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    text-align: center;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background-color: #C1272D;
    margin: 1px;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------- Misc chrome */

QLabel {
    background: transparent;
    color: #F2E4C4;
}

QLabel:disabled {
    color: #6E6E6E;
}

QSplitter::handle {
    background-color: #161616;
}

QSplitter::handle:hover {
    background-color: #D4AF37;
}

QScrollBar:vertical {
    background: #1F1F1F;
    width: 16px;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background-color: #3A3A3A;
    border: 1px solid #0D0D0D;
    min-height: 24px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {
    background-color: #C1272D;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {
    height: 0px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::add-page:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-page:vertical {
    background: none;
}

QScrollBar:horizontal {
    background: #1F1F1F;
    height: 16px;
    border: 2px solid #3A3A3A;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background-color: #3A3A3A;
    border: 1px solid #0D0D0D;
    min-width: 24px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #C1272D;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal {
    width: 0px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::add-page:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-page:horizontal {
    background: none;
}

QSizeGrip {
    background-color: #161616;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
}

QToolTip {
    background-color: #1F1F1F;
    color: #F2E4C4;
    border: 2px solid #C1272D;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   Propaganda side panel (src/torrent2000/ui/widgets/propaganda_panel.py)
   -- the extra strip of window width shown only under this theme.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */

QWidget#cccpPropagandaPanel {
    background-color: #0D0D0D;
    border-left: 3px solid #C1272D;
}

QLabel#propagandaHeader {
    color: #C1272D;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 10pt;
}

QLabel#propagandaMessage {
    color: #F2E4C4;
    font-size: 9pt;
}

QFrame#propagandaDivider {
    background-color: #D4AF37;
    border: none;
}
